@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18080
@memberToken = 替换为买家登录返回的token
@adminToken = 替换为管理员登录返回的token
@devKey = 替换为本地开发密钥

# 本文件为逐步手工演示；将响应中的ID和业务号填入后续请求。
# 所有金额均为整数分。不要把真实凭证保存或提交到仓库。


@categoryId = 1
@productId = 1
@skuId = 1

### 创建分类
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/catalog/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"学习用品"}

### 创建商品草稿，默认规格 SKU
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":"{{categoryId}}","title":"学习笔记本","imageUrls":[],"skus":[{"specificationValueIds":[],"priceFen":1990}]}

### 查询商品，获取 SKU id
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 入库；重复此键不能重复加库存，改变数量需使用新键
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/stock/{{skuId}}/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: learning-stock-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"delta":100}

### 上架
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/products/{{productId}}/sale
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"onSale":true}

### 买家检索
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=1&size=20&keyword=笔记本&minPriceFen=1000&maxPriceFen=3000

### 后台包含草稿与下架商品
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/products?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
